    "detailed_description": "L-Racers is a minimalistic, retro, 1980s arcade-style old school game where you go head-to-head against another player (CPU or human) and be the last racer alive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nUse your keyboard or an XInput-compatible gamepad, grab a friend and play like it's 1985!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAvailable game modes include: Single player versus CPU, 2-Player local PvP sharing the same keyboard, or both using gamepads, and Local Area Network play. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs of version 2.0, L-RACERS now have SPECIAL POWERS, including stopping on a dime, dashing at double speed, or laying explosive bombs for your opponent!",
